{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24283","headline":"刘苏州寄酿酒糯米李浙东寄杨柳枝舞衫偶因尝酒试衫輙成长句寄谢之 · 白居易","name":"刘苏州寄酿酒糯米李浙东寄杨柳枝舞衫偶因尝酒试衫輙成长句寄谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳枝谩蹋试双袖，桑落初香尝一杯。\n金屑醅浓吴米酿，银泥衫稳越娃裁。\n舞时已觉愁眉展，醉後仍教笑口开。\n慙媿故人怜寂寞，三千里外寄欢来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}